			"Message": "chore(project): Relicense project under CC0-1.0\n\n- Replaces the original Land Public License (LPL-1.0) with Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal public domain dedication\n- Removes copyleft requirements and complex licensing terms in favor of permissive public domain status\n- Aligns with Land's goals of fostering open collaboration by allowing unrestricted use/modification/distribution\n- Simplifies legal compliance for downstream users and contributors\n- Eliminates patent grant complexities and compatibility considerations from LPL\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: This changes the project's license from reciprocal copyleft (LPL) to public domain dedication. Downstream users must update their compliance practices accordingly.",
